# API token for the Michigan Imputation Server.
#
# 1. Sign up (free) at https://imputationserver.sph.umich.edu
# 2. Account → Profile → API Access → Create token
# 3. Save the token to ~/.michigan_token (one line, no quotes),
#    or export MICHIGAN_API_TOKEN=<token>.
#
# Do NOT commit the real token — it grants download access to every
# genome you've uploaded. .michigan_token is already in .gitignore.
#
# Panels available here: HRC r1.1 (default), 1000G Phase 3, CAAPA.
# For TOPMed r3 see .topmed_token.example — separate server, separate
# account, but the same `genepred impute michigan submit --server topmed`
# command.
